---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Frontend Debug Challenge">
  <main class="mx-auto flex min-h-[80vh] w-full max-w-4xl flex-col gap-10 px-6 py-24">
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900">
        Live Debugging Interview
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600">
        Welcome to the Team Spotlight exercise. During the session you and your interviewer
        will explore a broken page together, identify issues, and ship fixes without
        relying on AI assistants.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">What We&apos;ll Do</h2>
      <ol class="mt-6 list-decimal space-y-4 pl-6 text-base text-slate-600">
        <li>
          Ensure dependencies are installed (`npm install`) and spin up the dev server with
          <code>npm run dev</code> if it&apos;s not already running.
        </li>
        <li>
          Head to <code>/team-spotlight</code>, reproduce the issues, and walk through your
          debugging approach out loud.
        </li>
        <li>
          Once fixes are in place, recap what changed, how you verified the behaviour, and
          any follow-up improvements you&apos;d make.
        </li>
      </ol>
      <div class="mt-10 space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Issues to Explore</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-base text-slate-600">
          <li>• Team roster stays empty even after the API request resolves.</li>
          <li>• Team cards show stretched avatars and the contact details sit under the photo instead of sitting beside.</li>
          <li>• Spotlight carousel doesn&apos;t change the highlighted teammate.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-8">
        Ready? Start the pairing exercise on
        <a
          class="font-semibold text-sky-600 underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4 hover:text-sky-700"
          href="/team-spotlight"
          >the Team Spotlight page</a
        >.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
